{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50613","headline":"题灵泉寺 · 程序","name":"题灵泉寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟景[昼]（尽）冥冥，楼台隐翠屏。\n猨攀太子树，鸟听《法王经》。\n悟理心无着，求缘塔有灵。\n回车犹未远，日暮数峯青。\n（亦见《安阳县金石录》。\n）（按此诗与徐源、徐淮诗刻一石，诗下原题「广平程序字[土]〖古〗伦」七字。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"程序","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50613.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50613","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}